    "description": "What's backyard BBQ season without some tasty burgers? These 100% Pure Beef Burger Patties are made from 85% lean beef and 15% fat. They're quick-frozen and ready to cook at any time. Each 1/4 lb. beef patty of this 12 pack bag can be cooked on the grill, in a skillet, or broiled. They'll hold their shape and remain juicy no matter what cooking method you use. Use them for your next gathering or for a quick and easy meal that's ready to eat in minutes. These patties are also all natural, have no artificial ingredients, are minimally processed, and are USDA inspected. Discover all of our delicious and affordable frozen food options today.",
